  "title": "Hoàng-Reed Conjecture",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture Every digraph in which each vertex has outdegree at least $k$ contains $k$ directed cycles $C_1, \\ldots, C_k$ such that $C_j$ meets $\\cup_{i=1}^{j-1}C_i$ in at most one vertex, $2 \\leq j \\leq k$.",
